---
const astroLink = "https://astro.build/";
const lastUpdatedDate = "Feb 5, 2025";
---

<div class="flex flex-col min-h-[calc(100vh-5em)] justify-center items-center">
    <div class="flex flex-row items-center">
        <span class="md:text-9xl md:mr-14 text-7xl mr-7">🚧</span>
        <h1 class="font-bebas text-white md:text-7xl text-4xl">Under construction</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="font-montserrat text-white text-center mt-8 md:w-1/2 md:text-2xl w-2/3 text-lg">
        I recently learned the <a class="text-blue-500" href={astroLink}>Astro.build</a> framework and I'm rebuilding my
        personal site with it!
    </p>
    <span class="font-montserrat text-white mt-5 text-xs md:text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdatedDate}</span>
</div>
